Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.40,0:00:02.50,Tag,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Auto-repair. Auto-loot. Selling junk. Your UI already does that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.50,0:00:04.50,Tag,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}SMoRG's QoL does the little things nobody else does.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.70,0:00:07.10,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Finish a quest objective…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.10,0:00:10.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}…and the Human worker asks: {\c&H6AC4E8&}“More work?”{\c&HFFFFFF&}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.20,0:00:13.40,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Finish the whole quest…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.40,0:00:16.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}{\c&H6AC4E8&}“Job's done!”{\c&HFFFFFF&} Ready to turn in.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.00,0:00:20.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Playing Horde? Switch to the Peon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.00,0:00:24.50,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Above the mob: your quest count (1/7) and your range in yards.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.50,0:00:29.50,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Progress messages go from red through yellow to green.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.50,0:00:32.70,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}The last quilboar…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.70,0:00:36.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}{\c&H6AC4E8&}“Work complete.”{\c&HFFFFFF&} Each sound has its own on/off switch.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.00,0:00:41.00,CapTop,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}New quests are tracked automatically.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.00,0:00:46.00,CapTop,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Item level and speed on your player frame.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.00,0:00:52.00,CapTop,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Colored XP and rep numbers. The rep bar shows % left and standing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.00,0:00:56.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Tooltips show who a unit is targeting. Here: you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.00,0:01:00.50,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Achievements usually open on a wall of finished ones…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.50,0:01:04.20,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}…now they open on the ones you haven't earned yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.20,0:01:09.20,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Ready check and queue pop timers, party levels: every tweak is its own checkbox.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.40,0:01:11.80,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Also inside: floating rep gains, cursor shake highlight, a hand-drawn combat font.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.80,0:01:14.20,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Free for Retail and WoW Forever. Search for “SMoRGs QoL”.
